<title>USA: Hercules Inc files $500 mln debt shelf.</title>
<headline>Hercules Inc files $500 mln debt shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hercules Inc filed Friday with the Securities and Exchange Commission a shelf registration to sell up to $500 million in debt securities.</p>
<p>Net proceeds will be used for general corporate purposes, the company said in the filing.</p>
<p>Hercules, based in Wilmington, Del., is a diversified gobal producer of chemicals and related products.</p>
</text>
